==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cli-One]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Similarly to [[3rd Round: Dusk (Deadly)]], having all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] makes this stage playable; if you don't, then the stage is practically impossible, even with all of them up to Chapter 2's, because the [[Shibalien Elite]]s still have 1,050,000 HP each, and they also respawn forever. Even with them all, [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Aliens]] may still be helpful as the Shibalien Elites are still quite powerful, and may get in the way of the real threat; the Metal enemies. The [[Metal Doge]]s are annoying as usual, but thankfully there are only 8 of them in the stage; 3 of which spawn before the boss wave. [[Metal One Horn]] is present near the beginning of the stage, but can quickly be dispatched by a [[Critical Hit]] or two. The boss wave consists of the 5 remaining Metal Doges, [[Cli-One]], a [[Corporal Weyland]], and a highly buffed [[Sir Metal Seal]]. Cli-One and Weyland are strictly backliners to help the push of Sir Metal Seal, while the Metal Doges soak up Crits and other effects. [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoopmaster Cat]] and Critical Up [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] can work well against the Seal but consider if bringing these units will hamper your strategies [[2nd Round: Dawn (Deadly)|in]] [[2nd Round: Dusk (Deadly)|the]] [[3rd Round: Dawn (Deadly)|other]] [[3rd Round: Dusk (Deadly)|stages]] [[4th Round: Dawn (Merciless)|leading]] [[4th Round: Dusk (Merciless)|up]] to here is worth it. Once Sir Metal Seal is down, the rest of the stage should be simple.

